+/* Retro-Recomp: the "Retro-Recomp" page of the in-game options of a packed executable.
+ *
+ * It gathers what a player of the other Retro-Recomp machines expects in one place: the language of the menus, full screen,
+ * the scaling, the volumes and the entry to the keys and pad. The values are ScummVM's own keys; at the end of a run they are
+ * copied to datas/Retro-Recomp.ini (section [Adventure]) and applied again at the start of every adventure executable of the
+ * folder (see packed-fs.cpp), so a choice made in one game holds for all of them.
